    "title": "Thank You! to the Continental Lions Club - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Donaldson ,\n8 hours ago A huge shout-out to the Continental Lions Club for the wonderful evening they provided for our area senior citizens last night. More than 150 attendees enjoyed a delicious meal and great entertainment by Tom Armey and The Electric Raindrops at the Lions Club Annual Senior Citizen Dinner held at the Legion. Continental High School’s Honor Society and friends helped the Lions members serve the meal. The evening finished off with many wonderful door prizes. Thank you to the Lions Club for inviting our seniors out for such an enjoyable evening! Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
